<title>USA: INTEGON STAKE RAISED BY TWEEDY BROWNE GROUP.</title>
<headline>INTEGON STAKE RAISED BY TWEEDY BROWNE GROUP.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including New York investment adviser Tweedy, Browne Co LP said Tuesday it has increased its stake in Integon Corp to 1,103,665 shares or 7.01 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought more than 400,000 shares of the Winston-Salem, N.C. property and casualty insurance company between March 3 and April 23 at $12.75 to $14.625 each.</p>
</text>
